WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:05,480
Well, who hasn’t woken up yet?

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:06,680
It’s me, Boss Xia

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:13,700
Sister, sister, why are you here? Xiaolu misses you Xiaolu

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:26,530
The good guy said that the brother and sister are a pair of friends.

5
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:28,220
Then you guys chat and I'll leave first.

6
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:36,580
Boss Xia, please help us change to a double sister

7
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,980
Sister, we plan to go home a few days late

8
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,780
So I can still eat delicious food for several days

9
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:46,640
Thank you and let's go

10
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:51,940
What should I do if my child’s boyfriend is here and he can’t touch him casually?

11
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,940
Boss Xia has been waiting at the front desk and refused to leave.

12
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,340
What should I do? I'm hungry.
